# Products

Welcome to the Codexeron Product Documentation.

This section provides general information about digital products available on the Codexeron Marketplace.

Codexeron allows developers to publish and sell digital products including source code, scripts, plugins, APIs, tools, and other software resources.

---

# Product Types

Products on Codexeron may include:

- Source Code
- Scripts
- Plugins
- APIs
- Libraries
- Themes
- Development Tools
- Digital Software Products

---

# Product Information

Each product page may include:

- Product description
- Features
- Screenshots
- Requirements
- Supported technologies
- Version information
- Documentation
- License details

---

# Before Publishing

Sellers should ensure that products:

- Work as described.
- Include required files.
- Provide clear documentation.
- Follow marketplace rules.
- Respect intellectual property rights.

---

# Before Purchasing

Buyers should review:

- Product features
- Compatibility requirements
- Screenshots
- Documentation
- License terms
- Seller information

Choosing the right product helps create a better experience.

---

# Product Updates

Products may receive updates including:

- Bug fixes
- Security improvements
- Performance improvements
- New features
- Compatibility updates

Update availability depends on product license terms.

---

# Product Quality

Codexeron aims to maintain a reliable marketplace by encouraging:

- High-quality products
- Accurate descriptions
- Secure software practices
- Professional documentation

---

# Learn More

For detailed product information, visit:

https://www.codexeron.com

